(* HsLint (the haskell98 roadmap's M16, D54): the independent check of
   rhc's types. Its second inference, a transliteration of Typing Haskell
   in Haskell: its types and unifier, its dependency analysis, its classes
   and context reduction, its kinds, its reading of a program's
   declarations, its inference and its comparison with a record's claims,
   each its own, sharing nothing with the checker but the renamer of
   names.build; and its replay of Faxén's rules on the checker's evidence
   records (types.build), which it reads. *)
files
  hslint_types.sml
  hslint_scc.sml
  hslint_classes.sml
  hslint_kinds.sml
  hslint_env.sml
  hslint_infer.sml
  hslint_claims.sml
  hslint_replay.sml
  hslint_sig.sml
  hslint.sml
end
